BeachX.pack carries two licences.

1. The pipeline code (everything under beachx_pack/, scripts/, and tests/)
   is released under the MIT License, below.

2. The data under pack/ is a derivative database of OpenStreetMap and is
   released under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
   https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Attribution:
   "© OpenStreetMap contributors". Individual contents of that database
   are covered by the Database Contents License (DbCL) 1.0.

   Within pack/, the `description` fields are text from Wikipedia under
   CC BY-SA 4.0; each carries its source URL. Fields from US government
   sources (US Census Bureau, USGS, NOAA, National Weather Service) are
   public domain. Fields from Wikidata are CC0.

   The app that consumes these packs keeps them in a separate file beside
   its own data and references beaches by id. Nothing from pack/ is
   merged into the app's own database or sync.

